      "text": "Yi-Chia Chen @ Fields Model has reached 87.22 on ARC-AGI-2, leaving just 0.84 points to Tufa Labs at 88.06. The saved afternoon score event records Chen moving from 84.72 to 87.22; Tufa’s score is unchanged since the previous close. nvbanana also advances, with a recorded move from 81.39 to 83.89 putting it third, just ahead of Domdolus Tolus at 83.47. The pressure on the leader is now coming from a challenger within a point."
